{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-1","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──樹里、緊張してるか？","trans":"——树里，紧张吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6011004010010","name":"樹里","text":"まー、そりゃあ……な","trans":"嘛，那当然……吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6011004010020","name":"樹里","text":"最近はずーっと\r\n今日のことを考えてやってきたんだし","trans":"最近一直都\n想着今天的事过来的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……そうだな\r\nだから、大丈夫だ","trans":"……是啊\n所以，没问题的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"今日までの積み重ねが、\r\n樹里の力になってくれるよ","trans":"到今天为止的积累\n会成为树里的力量","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"プロデューサー","text":"だから、\r\n樹里は大丈夫","trans":"所以\n树里没问题的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"プロデューサー","text":"自信、持っていけ","trans":"拿出自信来","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6011004010050","name":"樹里","text":"……ん\r\nありがとな","trans":"……嗯\n谢了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6011004010060","name":"樹里","text":"じゃー、いってくる！","trans":"那，我出发了！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}